# Story phase model routing (required for `/ss-*` Story belt)

Before executing a Story-phase slash command, confirm the chat model matches `storyPhaseModels` in **`skillsync.config.json`** (skill: **`story-phase-models`**).

| Phase | Commands | Expected model (QuickPress default) |
|-------|----------|-------------------------------------|
| plan | `/ss-plan`, lens plans that feed plan | `claude-opus-5-5-medium` |
| cycle | `/ss-implement`, `/ss-loop` | `composer-2.5` |
| review | `/ss-review` | `claude-opus-5-5-medium` |
| fix | FAIL fixes inside `/ss-finish`, CI fix commits | `composer-2.5` |

If the human is on the wrong model, **stop** and ask them to open a **new chat** with the correct model, then re-run the same slash command. Do not improvise a different routing scheme mid-initiative.

Reference-import work still uses this table for phases 3–5 (plan → implement → review).
